如火灾、车祸、家人突发重病，把基本生活一时压垮了，就可以向乡镇政府或者街道办申请临时救助。不要求你已经是低保户。多是一次性发一笔，金额各地差别很…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["收入低于当地低保线就申请低保"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全家收入除以人数，低于当地低保线，家里财产也符合规定的，就可以申请。2024 年末，全国城市低保线平均每人每月 798.1 元，农村 593.9 元。批下来发的…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["持残疾人证的去申请残疾人两项补贴"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["低保家庭里的残疾人，可以领生活补贴。残疾等级是一级、二级，又需要长期照护的，可以领护理补贴。两项能同时领。标准各省自己定，差别很大，具体问街道。带上第二代残疾人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/07-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["居民医保每年 400 元不要断，困难户可减免"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["个人一年交 400 元起，财政再按人头补 700 元上下。特困人员全额资助，低保对象定额资助。断缴是有代价的：没在集中期参保、或者没连着交的，交完之后有 3 个…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/07"},"children":["阅读整个主题：没钱的时候怎么活 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"广告 · 社区推荐"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"生财有术官方 Logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-sp